# Cloudflare Workers assets sarlavhalari (QgqO0CdZ, KwodkKWY).
# _headers o'zi serverga chiqmaydi — deploydan keyin /_headers 404/SPA qaytarishi NORMAL.
# Bitta so'rovga bir nechta qoida mos kelsa, ular TARTIB bilan qo'llanadi: "! Nom" — oldingi qoida qo'ygan
# sarlavhani olib tashlaydi, keyin shu qoidadagi qiymat yoziladi.
#
# Xavfsizlik sarlavhalari (KwodkKWY, P1):
#   - Content-Security-Policy (MAJBURIY) — faqat xavfsiz qism: sahifani boshqa sayt iframe'iga qo'yib bo'lmaydi
#     (pul amallarida clickjacking), <base> almashtirilmaydi. X-Frame-Options — eski brauzerlar uchun.
#   - Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only — to'liq siyosat KUZATUV rejimida: hech narsani bloklamaydi, faqat
#     buzilishni konsolga yozadi. 1 hafta buzilishsiz o'tsa — majburiy rejimga o'tkaziladi.
#     INLINE_SCRIPT_HASHES joy tutuvchisi — build vaqtida dist/index.html ichki skriptlari xeshi bilan almashtiriladi
#     (vite.config.ts → scripts/csp-headers.mjs); bu faylni qo'lda xesh bilan to'ldirmang.
#     Manbalar: API (https + wss — socket.io /realtime), Google Fonts (Manrope), telegram.org (faqat /tg/scan SDK),
#     api.qrserver.com (paket/yorliq QR — chek kartasida QR lokal bo'lgach olib tashlanadi), blob: (qr-scanner
#     worker'i, PDF/eksport), data: (lokal QR, shrift). antd/inline style uchun style-src 'unsafe-inline'.
#   - Permissions-Policy — kamera FAQAT o'zimizga (skaner), qolgan qurilma API'lari o'chiq.
#   - Strict-Transport-Security — 1 yil, includeSubDomains'siz: shu domen ostidagi boshqa (HTTP) xizmatlarga tegmaydi.
/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(self), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=(), serial=(), hid=(), midi=(), magnetometer=(), gyroscope=(), accelerometer=(), display-capture=()
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  Content-Security-Policy-Report-Only: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' {{INLINE_SCRIPT_HASHES}} https://telegram.org; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline' https://fonts.googleapis.com; font-src 'self' data: https://fonts.gstatic.com; img-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.elchipochta.uz https://api.qrserver.com; media-src 'self' data: blob: https://api.elchipochta.uz; connect-src 'self' https://api.elchipochta.uz wss://api.elchipochta.uz https://fonts.googleapis.com https://fonts.gstatic.com; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' blob:; manifest-src 'self'; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'

# Kesh (04YKjCOD): `assets/` fayllari nomida mazmun xeshi bor (index-Ca3mceTy.js) — mazmuni hech qachon o'zgarmaydi,
# shuning uchun 1 yil + immutable: brauzer har ochishda qayta tasdiqlatmaydi (avval 38 tadan 37 tasi 304, ~7 s).
# index.html va SPA yo'llari — Cloudflare sukuti (`public, max-age=0, must-revalidate`): yangi deploy darhol ko'rinadi.
/assets/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

# Telegram Mini App (/tg/scan): Telegram Web (web.telegram.org) ilovani iframe ichida ochadi — faqat shu sahifaga
# Telegram'ning o'z domeni ruxsat etiladi (mobil/desktop Telegram iframe ishlatmaydi).
/tg/scan*
  ! X-Frame-Options
  ! Content-Security-Policy
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'self' https://web.telegram.org; base-uri 'self'

# Service Worker: asosiy shart — sw.js ning public/ da bo'lishi (dist/sw.js da Cloudflare JS turini o'zi beradi);
# bu qatorlar zaxira chora.
/sw.js
  Content-Type: application/javascript; charset=utf-8
  Service-Worker-Allowed: /
  Cache-Control: no-cache
